Deliberate divergences from the reference are documented in `src/grain.zig`'s
module doc (rejection vs reduction in two places, and the Grain output filter's
bit consumption) and in `src/mds_security.zig`'s (the two proved rewrites, and
`check_minpoly_condition` belonging to `generate_matrix_partial` rather than to
`generate_matrix`'s acceptance loop).

## NOT reproduced here: circomlib

`iden3/circomlib` and `circomlibjs` are **LGPL-3.0** and are used only as a
comparison target: `src/constants_test.zig` pins SHA-256 digests of tables THIS
module derives, and documents how to re-clone circomlibjs and recompute the
comparison yourself. No circomlib source and no circomlib data is present in
this repository, so its terms do not reach this module. It is recorded as a
design reference in the repository NOTICE §2.
